@startuml notification-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (notification-service) - FR-18\nOwner: Muhammed Hany Hamdy
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface INotification <<provided>> {
  +sendDeadlineReminders(): void
  +sendTaskReminders(): void
  +sendWarning(warning): void
  +notifyStreakMilestone(habitId, days): void
  +getNotifications(studentId): List<Notification>
}

class NotificationService <<component>> {
  -assessment: IAssessment
  -scheduling: IScheduling
  -habit: IHabit
  -prediction: IPrediction
  -emailGateway: IEmailGateway
  -repository: INotificationRepository
  -reminderScheduler: ReminderScheduler
  -channels: List<INotificationChannel>
  --
  +sendDeadlineReminders(...) / sendTaskReminders(...)
  +sendWarning(...) / notifyStreakMilestone(...)
  +getNotifications(...)
}

INotification <|.. NotificationService
class ReminderScheduler <<component>> {
  +dueReminders(now): List<Reminder>
}
NotificationService --> ReminderScheduler
class EmailChannel <<component>> {
  +send(notification): void
}

interface IAssessment <<required - Assessment service>> {
  +addAssignment(data): Assignment
  +addExam(data): Exam
  +setStatus(assignmentId, status): void
  +setExamReminder(examId, daysBefore): void
  +getDeadlines(studentId, days): List<Deadline>
}

NotificationService --> IAssessment
interface IScheduling <<required - Scheduling service>> {
  +scheduleTasks(studentId): Schedule
  +getConflicts(studentId): List<Conflict>
  +suggestSlots(taskId): List<TimeSlot>
  +moveTask(taskId, slot): void
  +markDone(taskId, done): void
  +getScheduledTasks(studentId, range): List<ScheduledTask>
}

NotificationService --> IScheduling
interface IHabit <<required - Habit service>> {
  +createHabit(studentId, data): Habit
  +markDone(habitId, date): void
  +getStreak(habitId): int
  +linkToGoal(habitId, goalId): void
  +getHabits(studentId): List<Habit>
}

NotificationService --> IHabit
interface IPrediction <<required - Prediction service>> {
  +getLikelihood(goalId): Likelihood
  +runCheck(studentId): void
  +getWarnings(studentId): List<EarlyWarning>
  +getRecoveryActions(warningId): List<RecoveryAction>
}

NotificationService --> IPrediction
interface IEmailGateway <<required - Email service>> {
  +send(to, subject, body): void
}

NotificationService --> IEmailGateway
interface INotificationRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Notification): void
  +findById(id): Notification
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Notification>
}

NotificationService --> INotificationRepository
class Notification {
  -notificationId: String
  -studentId: String
  -type: String
  -message: String
  -sentAt: Date
}
INotificationRepository --> Notification
interface INotificationChannel <<provided>> {
  +send(notification): void
}
INotificationChannel <|.. EmailChannel
NotificationService --> INotificationChannel : channels
EmailChannel --> IEmailGateway

note bottom of NotificationService
SOLID applied:
S - NotificationService only coordinates; ReminderScheduler, EmailChannel each do one job.
O - A new channel (push, SMS) is a new INotificationChannel class (OCP).
L - NotificationService can replace any other INotification implementation.
I - INotification has only the operations its clients use.
D - NotificationService depends on interfaces (IAssessment, IScheduling, IHabit, IPrediction, IEmailGateway, INotificationRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
